WEBVTT

1
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.125
So far we have learned that a true yogi,

2
00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:37.583
rising above life's sufferings,

3
00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:40.833
attains realization of Paramātmā. 

4
00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:42.458
And we have also learned

5
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:44.208
that progress in yoga is only possible

6
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:46.458
by controlling the mind.

7
00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.583
Now in this verse, Arjuna

8
00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:50.625
is expressing his doubt

9
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:53.000
regarding the difficulties of yoga.

10
00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.291
In this verse, Arjuna

11
00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:00.750
clearly places his doubt

12
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.750
before Lord Krishna.

13
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.791
Arjuna says, "O Madhusudana,

14
00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:08.541
the method of yoga you have explained

15
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:10.166
seems unrealistic

16
00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:12.875
and impractical to me."

17
00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.833
This doubt is natural.

18
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:17.416
Lord Krishna has described such a yogi

19
00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:19.291
who views not only humans

20
00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:22.208
but also all beings with equal vision –

21
00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:25.208
then neither friend remains nor enemy,

22
00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:27.083
all are equal.

23
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:29.666
For a kshatriya like Arjuna, understanding this

24
00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:33.166
is very difficult. Because this means

25
00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:34.791
that brother like Yudhishthira

26
00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:36.625
and enemy like Duryodhana,

27
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.208
both must be seen with the same vision.

28
00:01:39.208 --> 00:01:42.250
And that too, on the battlefield?

29
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.291
This seems unbelievable to Arjuna.

30
00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:47.291
Arjuna also doubts

31
00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.333
that the mind is extremely restless,

32
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:52.000
so then how is controlling it possible?

33
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.458
Understand this –

34
00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:54.958
Arjuna accepts

35
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:56.916
that the principles taught by Lord Krishna

36
00:01:56.916 --> 00:02:01.583
are great, but remaining steady
 on these principles for long

37
00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.291
seems difficult to him.

38
00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:07.791
Especially when there's a
 serious situation like war.

39
00:02:07.791 --> 00:02:11.041
An important thing must be understood here –

40
00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:14.166
Arjuna is not rejecting Lord Krishna's words,

41
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:14.875
rather

42
00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:17.541
he is questioning his own capability.

43
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:19.666
Arjuna accepts that seeing everyone with equal

44
00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:22.583
vision is a high ideal,

45
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:23.500
but reaching

46
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.333
that state himself

47
00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:27.500
seems very difficult to him.

48
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.625
Perhaps such doubt is in your mind too,

49
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.291
because in everyone's life such moments come

50
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:36.666
where controlling the mind seems difficult,

51
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:38.708
where spiritual advancement

52
00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:40.708
seems unbelievable.

53
00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:43.583
But this is not a matter for despair,

54
00:02:43.583 --> 00:02:46.500
because only when there's awareness
 of these shortcomings

55
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.541
will progress happen.

56
00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:49.166
Just as

57
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:51.000
Arjuna with the purpose of learning,

58
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.083
is expressing his doubt,

59
00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:54.000
we too

60
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.083
should never hesitate

61
00:02:55.083 --> 00:02:58.166
to ask for proper guidance.

62
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:00.791
Only from this can we make progress.

63
00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:07.083
Whether enemies

64
00:03:07.083 --> 00:03:12.625
or friends, whether family 
members or anyone else,

65
00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.458
seeing everyone

66
00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:16.791
with the same vision –

67
00:03:16.791 --> 00:03:17.458
this ideal

68
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.666
must seem quite impossible to you,

69
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:23.750
and I understand this.

70
00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.791
Arjuna here

71
00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:29.750
is very clearly stating his doubt.

72
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:34.416
Accepting one's shortcomings
 with such honesty

73
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:37.250
is a very commendable quality.

74
00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:41.750
This is the first step of progress.

75
00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.958
This is a sign

76
00:03:43.958 --> 00:03:47.875
that you are certainly willing to move forward,

77
00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:53.708
only there's a lack of proper guidance.

78
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:57.000
And guidance will also come

79
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:02.000
only when you request someone for it.

80
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.583
Whereas on the contrary,

81
00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:08.750
many people, due to ego, 
neither see their shortcomings

82
00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.500
nor ask for guidance.

83
00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:15.333
For this very reason, they cannot succeed.

84
00:04:15.333 --> 00:04:17.208
To make progress,

85
00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:20.916
these three things are extremely essential:

86
00:04:20.916 --> 00:04:22.291
First,

87
00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:25.416
Recognize and

88
00:04:25.416 --> 00:04:28.083
accept your shortcomings.

89
00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:32.666
Try to improve yourself.

90
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:35.750
And Third, definitely take help

91
00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.541
from experienced people.

92
00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:40.791
And yes,

93
00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:42.000
just as Arjuna

94
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.833
clearly told me

95
00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:46.375
about his difficulties,

96
00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:52.625
you too can ask me for help.

97
00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:56.083
I will only be pleased by this.

98
00:04:56.083 --> 00:04:57.916
Because asking for help,

99
00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:02.375
or accepting difficulty is not weakness,

100
00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:06.416
but a big step forward.

101
00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:15.791
Arjuna is telling me his doubt without hesitation.

102
00:05:15.791 --> 00:05:20.458
The relationship between us is like this.

103
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:24.208
This is not only the relationship
 of teacher and disciple,

104
00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:26.416
but there is also love

105
00:05:26.416 --> 00:05:29.125
and trust in it.

106
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:33.458
Family atmosphere should also be like this,

107
00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:36.416
where there's love, there's trust.

108
00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:38.416
Where there's no fear

109
00:05:38.416 --> 00:05:41.625
that someone will misunderstand you.

110
00:05:41.625 --> 00:05:42.708
Where you can

111
00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:46.708
talk openly about your difficulties.

112
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:52.125
In external society, many times,
 a person is afraid to tell the truth.

113
00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:54.541
Even if bad times are going on in life,

114
00:05:54.541 --> 00:06:00.250
they say everything is fine.

115
00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.375
A kind of fear remains in the mind

116
00:06:03.375 --> 00:06:06.958
that people will consider us weak.

117
00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:09.958
But this shouldn't happen in family.

118
00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:15.500
If family members don’t support
 in difficult times, then who will?

119
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:20.166
So understand this matter from both aspects:

120
00:06:20.166 --> 00:06:23.541
Become trustworthy for others in the family.

121
00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:24.541
So that people can

122
00:06:24.541 --> 00:06:28.291
share their sorrow with you without hesitation,

123
00:06:28.291 --> 00:06:32.083
can tell you what's in their heart.

124
00:06:32.083 --> 00:06:36.208
On the other hand, also keep this in mind –

125
00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:40.750
if you're going through difficult times,

126
00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.916
definitely share with someone in the family.

127
00:06:44.916 --> 00:06:48.833
Asking for help is not weakness at all.

128
00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:52.333
Rather, this is a step forward.

129
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:54.291
So just

130
00:06:54.291 --> 00:06:57.958
become worthy of trust for others,

131
00:06:57.958 --> 00:07:00.625
and in sorrows you also

132
00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:03.291
trust someone dear.

133
00:07:03.291 --> 00:07:08.708
Never hesitate to take emotional help.

134
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:14.666
This makes mutual relationships sweet and firm.

135
00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:23.000
Arjuna has placed his doubt before me

136
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:27.541
with a completely truthful feeling.

137
00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:32.750
And I will also remove all his doubts.

138
00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:36.625
But in professional settings,
 expressing one's feelings

139
00:07:36.625 --> 00:07:38.708
with this same honesty,

140
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:42.000
or telling some shortcoming of one's own

141
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.833
often seems difficult.

142
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:48.625
There's a kind of fear in the mind

143
00:07:48.625 --> 00:07:51.958
about what colleagues will think about us.

144
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:54.750
And if guidance is asked from someone,

145
00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.333
senior officials will think

146
00:07:57.333 --> 00:08:00.500
we are incapable.

147
00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:05.083
The mind does this – nothing
 should be said to anyone.

148
00:08:05.083 --> 00:08:09.666
Just wear a mask of strength.

149
00:08:09.666 --> 00:08:13.875
So remembering these things
 here is extremely essential:

150
00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:15.750
First,

151
00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:19.500
become a good colleague.

152
00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.708
Such a person before whom someone else

153
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:28.708
doesn't hesitate when expressing
 their feelings or shortcomings.

154
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:30.625
Help others.

155
00:08:30.625 --> 00:08:34.041
When you help others in this way,

156
00:08:34.041 --> 00:08:38.375
it will start to be understood that asking for help

157
00:08:38.375 --> 00:08:40.833
is not weakness.

158
00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:44.541
And now from this very thing,

159
00:08:44.541 --> 00:08:46.916
strength to ask for help will also come in you.

160
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:50.125
You too don't hesitate to ask for cooperation

161
00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:53.208
from some experienced official.

162
00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:56.000
Moving forward by asking for help

163
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.958
is better than stopping.

164
00:08:57.958 --> 00:08:59.875
And yes,

165
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:02.750
if you are in a leadership position,

166
00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.625
creating such an environment in the organization

167
00:09:05.625 --> 00:09:07.166
is your responsibility.

168
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:10.708
Where people respect others' feelings.

169
00:09:10.708 --> 00:09:14.458
Where people don't hesitate.
 Neither in giving help,

170
00:09:14.458 --> 00:09:17.708
nor in asking for help.

171
00:09:17.708 --> 00:09:20.000
Remember this.
